o death in the arms of a friend. After several weeks of mourning, you return to court. What is your first act?","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":4},{"author":"Andy Auseon","conditions":["Child Of Leader Us","Child Or Teenager","Not Blessed"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_DEATH_DARK_WATERS","name":"Dark Waters","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain trait: Mourning","tip":["As leader: -10% Orders"],"tipTitle":"Mourning — trait"},{"text":"+1 Courage"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeAddTraits: TRAIT_MOURNING","aeBonuses: BONUS_GAIN_COURAGE_1"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_DEATH_DARK_WATERS_OPTION_0","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"I will address the people about this tragedy."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain trait: Mourning","tip":["As leader: -10% Orders"],"tipTitle":"Mourning — trait"},{"text":"Opinion memory"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeAddTraits: TRAIT_MOURNING"],"id":"BONUS_GIVE_TRAIT_MOURNING","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["Memory MEMORYFAMILY_COMFORTED_GRIEVING_FAMILY"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_DEATH_DARK_WATERS_OPTION_1_FAMILY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"I will stay in the palace and comfort my family."}],"subjects":["Leader Us","Family Us","Family Us"],"text":"During a swim in the river, your son [character] is overcome by a powerful current and swept beneath the surface. By the time our servants pull [character]'s body ashore, he is already dead. Our advisors await your command.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":1},{"author":"Andy Auseon","conditions":["Late Teenager","Not Blessed","Not Ascetic"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_DEATH_DEADLY_DRINK","name":"Deadly Drink","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain trait: Mourning","tip":["As leader: -10% Orders"],"tipTitle":"Mourning — trait"},{"eachCity":60,"text":"+60 Happiness (each city)","yield":"happiness"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeAddTraits: TRAIT_MOURNING","aeBonuses: BONUS_HAPPINESS_GAIN_S