e"},"weight":2},{"author":"Andy Auseon","conditions":["Child","Not Blessed"],"guaranteed":[{"text":"Gain trait: Mourning","tip":["As leader: -10% Orders"],"tipTitle":"Mourning — trait"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_DEATH_TRAMPLED","name":"Trampled","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":30,"per":10,"text":"+30 Food (+10/city)","yield":"food"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_FOOD=30","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_FOOD=10"],"id":"BONUS_FOOD_GAIN_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Gift his favorite horse to a local farm."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+1 Melee Cavalry unit"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiBonusUnits: BONUSUNITCLASS_MELEE_CAVALRY=1"],"id":"BONUS_UNITCLASS_MELEE_CAVALRY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Have the horse take to the battlefield in his name."}],"subjects":["Leader Us","Child Of Leader Us","Tech Spoked Wheel Discovered Us"],"text":"During a riding lesson, your young son [character] slips from his saddle and is trampled beneath the horse's hooves. It happens in seconds. He does not suffer. In shock, the court prepares to honor its fallen son.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":2},{"author":"Andy Auseon","conditions":["Child","Not Blessed"],"guaranteed":[{"text":"Gain trait: Mourning","tip":["As leader: -10% Orders"],"tipTitle":"Mourning — trait"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_DEATH_VANISHED","name":"Vanished","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+30–300 Culture (by city tier)","yield":"culture"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aaiCultureYield: CULTURE_WEAK[YIELD_CULTURE=30], CULTURE_DEVELOPING[YIELD_CULTURE=60], CULTURE_STRONG[YIELD_CULTURE=120], CULTURE_LEGENDARY[YIELD_CULTURE=300]"],"id":"BONUS_CULTURE_GAIN_AVERAGE","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Family is our most important treasure."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"eachCity":80,"text":"+80 Happiness (each city)","yield":"happiness"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiCityYields: YIELD_HAPPINESS=80"],"id":"BONUS_HAPPINESS_GAIN_AVERAGE","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"We will find who did this and punish them."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+2 Legitimacy"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iLegitimacy 2"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_DEATH_VANISHED_OPTION_2","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[{"tag":"LeaderSubject","values":["SUBJECT_STRICT"]}]},"requirements":[],"text":"May his weakness be an example."}],"subjects":["Leader Us","Child Of Leader Us"],"text":"On a visit to the market, your son [character] runs free of his bodyguards and vanishes into the crowds. Days later, there is still no sign of the child, and you prepare for the worst. People come to pay their respects. What will you tell them?","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":1},{"author":"Josh Unsworth","conditions":["Adult","Religion Rome","Not Important Us"],"dlc":"Religion event pack","id":"EVENTSTORY_WHERE_LIGHTNING_STRIKES","name":"Where Lightning Strikes","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+20–200 Culture (by city tier)","yield":"culture"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aaiCultureYield: CULTURE_WEAK[YIELD_CULTURE=20], CULTURE_DEVELOPING[YIELD_CULTURE=40], CULTURE_STRONG[YIELD_CULTURE=80], CULTURE_LEGENDARY[YIELD_CULTURE=200]"],"id":"BONUS_CULTURE_GAIN_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Bury [character] at the spot where he fell and consecrate the space."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"eachCity":80,"text":"+80 Happiness (each city)","yield":"happiness"},{"base":-20,"per":-5,"text":"-20 Food (-5/city)","yield":"food"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiCityYields: YIELD_HAPPINESS=80"],"id":"BONUS_HAPPINESS_GAIN_AVERAGE","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_FOOD=-20","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_FOOD=-5"],"id":"BONUS_FOOD_LOSS_TINY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Make further sacrifices in [city] to ensure the god's wrath does not extend to the city."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain a random trait"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeRandomTraitDelay: TRAIT_SUPERSTITIOUS, TRAIT_PIOUS, TRAIT_BRAVE","aeRandomTraitText: TEXT_BONUS_EVENTOPTION_WHERE_LIGHTNING_STRIKES_SUPERSTITIOUS, TEXT_BONUS_EVENTOPTION_WHERE_LIGHTNING_STRIKES_PIOUS, TEXT_BONUS_EVENTOPTION_WHERE_LIGHTNING_STRIKES_BRAVE"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_WHERE_LIGHTNING_STRIKES_OPTION_2_PLAYER","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Travel to observe the site and witness Jupiter's power."}],"pack":"The Sacred and the Profane","subjects":["Religion Player Pagan","City Us","Non Leader Us","Player Us"],"text":"Lightning has rained down near [city] in a terrifying display of Jupiter's divine wrath. [character], caught in the storm, was struck by the lightning and was killed where he stood. The want to raise a shrine to Jupiter, to mark the cursed ground and warn away any who would tread there.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bidental","weight":1}],"part":{"count":15,"first":"A Long Fall","last":"Where Lightning Strikes","slug":"sudden-death"}}
